    "title": "Veridor blast-radius demo: deliberate sibling asymmetry",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Two path families whose members should behave alike. The fixture server deliberately lets one identity through on exactly one member of each family, so sibling diffing has a real inconsistency to find without anybody declaring a policy first."
